    "description": "Stardom is a 43-metre tri-deck superyacht based in Dubai, designed for guests who want more than a cruise: generous decks, a refined interior and the space to host up to 100 guests for a celebration or a corporate event.\n\nThe main deck opens onto a large aft deck with lounge and dining areas, followed by a bright saloon. Upstairs, the sky lounge and the flybridge with its bar look out over Dubai Marina, Palm Jumeirah and Ain Dubai.\n\nFive cabins allow guests to rest during longer charters. A crew of 6 looks after the yacht and her guests from boarding to return.\n\nContact Yacht Research for availability, routes and a tailored quote.",
